## 🎁 组件样式规范

### 卡片组件
```css
.newspaper-card {
  background: var(--newspaper-paper);
  border: 1px solid var(--newspaper-border);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 6px var(--newspaper-shadow);
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.newspaper-card:hover {
  box-shadow: 3px 3px 8px var(--newspaper-shadow);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.newspaper-card-important {
  border: 2px solid var(--newspaper-accent);
  box-shadow: 3px 3px 8px rgba(139, 115, 85, 0.25);
}
```

### 按钮组件
```css
.newspaper-button {
  background-color: var(--newspaper-green);
  border: 1px solid var(--newspaper-dark-green);
  color: var(--newspaper-paper);
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-family: 'SimHei', sans-serif;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.newspaper-button:hover {
  background-color: var(--newspaper-dark-green);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 4px var(--newspaper-shadow);
}

.newspaper-button-secondary {
  background-color: var(--newspaper-accent);
  border: 1px solid var(--newspaper-accent);
}
```

### 装饰元素
```css
.newspaper-divider {
  height: 1px;
  background-color: var(--newspaper-light-gray);
  margin: 12px 0;
}

.newspaper-header-frame {
  border: 2px solid var(--newspaper-accent);
  padding: 20px;
  background: var(--newspaper-paper);
  position: relative;
}

.newspaper-header-frame::before,
.newspaper-header-frame::after {
  content: '◆';
  position: absolute;
  color: var(--newspaper-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
}
```

