## 📱 响应式设计

### 移动端优化
```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .newspaper-page {
    padding: 16px 8px;
  }
  
  .newspaper-title-large {
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  
  .masonry-container {
    column-count: 1;
    column-gap: 0;
  }
}
```

### 平板端优化
```css
@media (min-width: 769px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
  .masonry-container {
    column-width: 280px;
    column-gap: 20px;
  }
}
```

### 桌面端优化
```css
@media (min-width: 1025px) {
  .masonry-container {
    column-width: 320px;
    column-gap: 24px;
  }
}
```

